mit report\nCached time: 20261017051456\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 766/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 24410/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.781      1 -total\n 61.85%    8.523      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 37.23%    5.131      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15927:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017051456 and revision id 279344. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}